  o<twp_grid_run_pose> call [12.0] [-30.0] [90.0] [0.0] [30.0] [90.0]
o<twp_grid_pose_12> endif

(C180 quadrant.)
o<twp_grid_pose_13> if [#<_twp_grid_start_pose> LE 13.0]
  o<twp_grid_run_pose> call [13.0] [5.0] [180.0] [-90.0] [5.0] [-90.0]
